+- `content-policy.mjs` on the batch-50 manifest: 2 items, 0 errors, 0 warnings.
+- `precheck.mts`: 2 items, 0 failing; the Postulate passes nonproof structure and the Example passes direct-proof format.
+- `rendercheck.mjs`: 4 changed item/page files, 0 errors, 0 warnings. `proof-layout.mjs` on the two changed items: 6 steps, 0 defects.
