+- Add or identify an N=2* U(2) finite-regulator Ward result on `qftx-qexact-field-theory-localization` (proposed item `pthm-qftx-n2star-u2-regulated-ward-identity`) with the exact A1 measure, cycle, anomaly, domination, and boundary hypotheses. The current ready N=4 SU(2) theorem is not a substitute.
